! Infrastructure as Myth — the submission seat

This address holds the seat for the ''Infrastructure as Myth'' arXiv submission. The finished paper
stands here as a submittable `.md` + `.meta` pair, produced by the deterministic meme→markdown
pipeline the spec submissions share.

The working design surface — the doctrine-and-paper draft the submission condenses from — rides the documentation shelf:

